            "id": "lem:small-facet-catalogue-counts",
            "kind": "lemma",
            "statement": "The exact primitive canonical facet counts at the first four outcome resolutions are\n\\[\nF_2=7,\\qquad F_3=59,\\qquad F_4=197,\\qquad F_5=721.\n\\]",
            "free_symbols": [
